# Worker Application

Background job processor for async tasks.

## Structure (to be created)

```
worker/
├── src/
│   ├── processors/
│   │   ├── notification.processor.ts
│   │   ├── email.processor.ts
│   │   └── analytics.processor.ts
│   ├── services/
│   └── main.ts
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

## Jobs Handled

- Email notifications
- Push notifications
- Data aggregation
- Report generation
- File processing
- Search indexing

## Tech Stack

- Node.js 20
- Bull
- Redis
- Shared backend services
